# Org Chart — Donchitos Game Studio (49 agents)

Generated from `agents/*/AGENTS.md` frontmatter (`reportsTo` and
`metadata.modelTier`), current as of the Work Item 9/10 pass. This is the
canonical source for the org structure diagram; `images/org-chart.png` was
generated once by an earlier phase's tooling and is not part of this
package's regeneration path (no such tooling exists in this repo) — treat
this Mermaid file as authoritative if the two ever disagree, and regenerate
the PNG externally from this file when needed.

Purple = Tier 1 (decision-only, `claude-opus-5-5`). Blue = Tier 2 (execution,
`claude-sonnet-5`). Green = Tier 3 (high-volume/templated,
`claude-haiku-4-5-20251001`). Full tier definitions in `docs/model-tiers.md`.

